+"""Verified Track-B generator for arXiv:2409.15713.
+
+The native object is a succinct Sperner coloring of an exact barycentric
+lattice in a 2-simplex.  A witness is a trichromatic elementary triangle.
+
+Generation is inverse.  A boundary transition is sampled first; an affine
+recurrence is then chosen backwards so that its state at the public horizon is
+that transition.  The witness is therefore known before the public coloring
+circuit exists and is never obtained by solving the generated instance.
