paper_src/hardness-warmup.tex:8:    In particular, there is a reduction in $\poly(n,k)$ time that reduces a 2{\rm D}-\Sperner instance with triangulation side-length of $2^n$ to a \outofk Approximate \Sperner instance with triangulation side-length of $2^{-3kn}$.
