paper_src/hardness-warmup.tex:41:\paragraph{The instances.} This family of instances is constructed based on the hard instances of \textcite{DBLP:journals/tcs/ChenD09}.
paper_src/hardness-warmup.tex:42:They first construct a core rectangle which has a  boundary condition similar to $2$D-\Sperner, and show that it is \PPAD-hard to find a small trichromatic triangle in the core rectangle. 
