-Applications to Envy-Free Cake Cutting](https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.15713).
+Generation composes identities. For moving poles `R(t)` and `R(t)+A`, the recurrence
+is built so the cross-ratio
+
+```text
+u_t = (s_t - R(t) - A) / (s_t - R(t))  (mod P)
+```
